  34:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc **** /**
  35:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  * This version of detection_postprocess is specific to TFLite Micro. It
  36:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  * contains the following differences between the TFLite version:
  37:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  *
  38:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  * 1.) Temporaries (temporary tensors) - Micro use instead scratch buffer API.
  39:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  * 2.) Output dimensions - the TFLite version does not support undefined out
  40:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  * dimensions. So model must have static out dimensions.
  41:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/detection_postprocess.cc ****  */
